<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>土耳其的紧缩措施显示出市场平静的早期迹象</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-s-tightening-steps-show-early-signs-of-calming-markets</link><description>土耳其收紧金融状况的最新举措显示出为该国动荡的市场带来稳定并减缓流行套利交易的早期迹象。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-s-tightening-steps-show-early-signs-of-calming-markets'&gt;土耳其的紧缩措施显示出市场平静的早期迹象&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey’s Tightening Steps Show Early Signs of Calming Markets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-s-tightening-steps-show-early-signs-of-calming-markets</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:12:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>厄尔尼诺现象和洪水给南非水果生产商带来压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/el-nino-flooding-put-squeeze-on-south-african-fruit-producers</link><description>由于冬季洪水和厄尔尼诺天气现象引起的热浪等恶劣天气，南非的高价值水果出口面临压力，种植者下调了葡萄和核果的收成预测。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/el-nino-flooding-put-squeeze-on-south-african-fruit-producers'&gt;厄尔尼诺现象和洪水给南非水果生产商带来压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：El Niño, Flooding Put Squeeze on South African Fruit Producers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/el-nino-flooding-put-squeeze-on-south-african-fruit-producers</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:13:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rally After Holiday as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能风暴肆虐，英国和欧洲市场是投资者的避风港吗？现场问答</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-12-01/live-q-amp-a-are-uk-and-european-markets-a-haven-from-the-ai-storm</link><description>彭博社记者将于 12 月 1 日星期二下午 1 点在现场问答中回答您有关英国和欧洲市场的问题。格林威治标准时间&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-12-01/live-q-amp-a-are-uk-and-european-markets-a-haven-from-the-ai-storm'&gt;人工智能风暴肆虐，英国和欧洲市场是投资者的避风港吗？现场问答&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：As the AI Storm Rages, Are UK and Europe Markets a Haven For Investors? Live Q&amp;A&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/sessions/2026-12-01/live-q-amp-a-are-uk-and-european-markets-a-haven-from-the-ai-storm</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:35:54 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>